* From J. C. Shaw, "JOSS: Examples of the Use of an Experimental On-Line Computing Service", RAND P-3131, April 1965, page 5.
*  Root finding:

1.1 Set w=y.
1.2 Do part 2 for x=x+d.
1.3 Set d=d·y/(w-y).
1.4 To part 1 if |y|≥e.
1.5 Type "Root".

2.1 Set y=exp(x)-20·log(x).
2.2 Type x,y in form 1.

Form 1:
x = __.______   y = __.______

Type step 1.4.
Do part 2 for x=.5(.5)3.
Do part 2 for x=3.5, 4.
Do part 2 for x=1.2.
Do part 1 for d=-.05.
Set e=.00005.
Go.
Do part 2 for x=3.1.
Do part 1 for d=.1.
Do part 2 for x=x-.000001.
Delete all.
